    <string name="onboarding_p3_title">Your smart care companion.. not a substitute for your doctor</string>
    <string name="onboarding_p3_body">DermaXRAI is designed to help you understand your daily skin needs and build a balanced, transparent routine; it never replaces specialized medical consultation.</string>
